# Notebook-execution artefacts written by the SQI_pipeline tutorial.
# `save_segment` writes per-segment CSVs into accept/ and reject/ folders
# whenever the notebook is run; these are regenerated on every build and
# should never be checked in.
docs/source/_examples/notebooks/accept/
docs/source/_examples/notebooks/reject/
**/subsegments_frequency/*
**/subsegments_time/*

